# The gear button opens the settings panel; the light theme applies at once; Escape closes it.
# Run with CADLITE_CONFIG_DIR pointing at a scratch folder so no real config is touched. The last
# steps put the dark theme back so later scenarios sharing that folder start the same.
app -demo
shot before
click 1240 62
wait 300
shot panel
expect-diff before panel
click 562 140
wait 300
shot light
expect-diff panel light
key Escape
wait 300
shot light_closed
key ctrl+comma
wait 300
shot reopened
click 430 140
wait 300
key Escape
wait 300
shot dark_again
expect-same before dark_again
